Third-party software bundled into dist/epherem-scanner.cjs
==========================================================

The scanner has no runtime dependencies: the packages below are built into
dist/epherem-scanner.cjs. Tools used only to build and test it (esbuild,
vitest, ajv, ajv-formats, @types/node) are not distributed with it.


